GymConnect Ultimate Master Blueprint — Complete Phased Roadmap
Phase 1: Cloud Backend & Foundation
Multi-Tenant Architecture: Supabase database configuration with Tenant IDs for complete gym isolation.

Security Policies: Row-Level Security (RLS) enforcement.

Spatial & Tracking Extensions: PostGIS Extension setup for GPS location matching and nearby gym discovery.

Audit Watchdog: Immutable system audit logs to track all database operations (CRUD).

Phase 2: Mobile App Shell, Auth & Role-Switching Engine
Role-Switching Engine: Automatic user role detection (Owner, Staff, Member, Public) upon login.

Persistent Sessions: Secure local token storage for seamless app restarts (Auth Gate).

Responsive Mobile Shell: Adaptive navigation setup across different views.

Phase 3: Member Portal & Virtual AI Trainer (The Core USP)
Goal Onboarding & Calendar: Visual body type UI cards and 90-day smart auto-loading workout calendars.

Zero-Friction UX: "One-Tap" daily action buttons and haptic feedback/vibration loops.

PIP Video Integration: Silent, looping exercise form video auto-play.

Live Pedometer & Tracking: Native Flutter background step counting, distance (km), and calorie burn estimation.

Gamification: 7-day streak badges, PR confetti animations, and leaderboards.

Phase 4: Staff Dashboard & POS Module
Front-Desk Operations: Member registration, fee collection, and attendance check-ins.

Hardware Intersections: Thermal receipt printer, cash drawer auto-kick, and barcode scanner integration.

Advanced Billing: Walk-in fees, split payments (Cash + Card), and "Khata System" for credit (udhaar) tracking.

Inventory Management: Low-stock alerts for supplements and gear.

Phase 5: Desktop App (Electron.js) & Hardware Gate Control
Local POS Database: SQLite integration for offline-first reception operations and background syncing.

Gate Display Screen: 10-second dynamic QR code generator for visitor/member entry.

Hardware Trigger: Local API signal transmission to ESP32 Wi-Fi relay modules to open magnetic gate locks.

Shift Reporting: Z-Reports (End of Day Tally), defaulters lists, and petty cash trackers.

Phase 6: Gym Owner & Super Admin Mothership Panels
Owner Security & Live Ops: Biometric app lock (FaceID/Fingerprint) and RTSP live security camera feed streaming.

Anti-Theft Engine: Real-time push alerts for voided or deleted invoices by staff.

Super Admin Control: Global SaaS revenue metrics, tenant suspension tools, and global audit log viewers.

God Mode: Secure impersonation engine allowing direct login as any owner, staff, or member for troubleshooting.

Phase 7: Public Marketplace & E-Commerce Store
Discovery UX: Airbnb-style map view with swipeable gym interior cards, real-time distance, and ETA.

Frictionless Conversion: Instant 24-hour temporary guest pass claims and direct online membership purchases.

In-App Store: Supplement and gear ordering for in-gym pickup.

Trust Engine: Verified-only ratings and reviews, alongside a locked AI trainer preview for public FOMO.

Phase 8: Cloud Automation, Hosting & Deployment
Edge Functions & Webhooks: Automated payment listeners, subscription expiry lockouts, and WhatsApp/SMS notification triggers.

Media Storage: Vercel Blob hosting integration for exercise demonstration videos and product images.

Publishing & CI/CD: Google Play Store, Apple App Store deployments, and Windows .exe desktop installer generation.